hildren":"Our brand-to-build \r\nframework."}]}]}],["$","$L25",null,{"slides":[{"media":{"mediaItemUrl":"/__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2026/07/Strategy-Firstv2-compressed.mp4","mimeType":"video/mp4"},"image":{"mediaItemUrl":"/__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2026/07/strategy-first.jpg"},"title":"Strategy first. \r\nAlways.","description":"It all starts with clear thinking. Through stakeholder interviews and workshops, we immerse ourselves in your world to sharpen your positioning, messaging and direction before anyone touches the visuals."},{"media":{"mediaItemUrl":"/__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2026/07/Find-The-Bold-Idea-compressed.mp4","mimeType":"video/mp4"},"image":{"mediaItemUrl":"/__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2026/07/find-the-bold-idea.jpg"},"title":"Find the \r\nbold idea.","description":"We’ll push you creatively, but we’ll always ground our ideas in strategy. From brand identity design to website interactions and immersion, every detail earns its place."},{"media":{"mediaItemUrl":"/__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2026/07/Nail-The-Process-compressed.mp4","mimeType":"video/mp4"},"image":{"mediaItemUrl":"/__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2026/07/nail-the-process.jpg"},"title":"Nail the \r\nprocess.","description":"We’re collaborative, decisive, and clear from day one. You’ll feel the momentum. You’ll know where you stand. You’ll have a team that knows when to lead, and when to listen."},{"media":{"mediaItemUrl":"/__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2026/07/Create-To-Convert-compress.mp4","mimeType":"video/mp4"},"image":{"mediaItemUrl":"/__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2026/07/create-to-convert.jpg"},"title":"Create to \r\nconvert.","description":"We sweat the small stuff. That means from brand visuals to SEO and UX flow, every creative decision is designed to boost engagement, drive conversions, and build brand equity."},{"media":{